        "created_at": "2013-05-31T14:09:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am not quite sure that Nightmist can do that. The rule of thumb is that \"reveal\" effects do not trigger a reshuffle. Nightmist would fall into that catagory.</p><p>With Self-Destruct, you are not \"revealing\" the cards. You are taking the top two cards to put under. In this sense, yes it would trigger a reshuffle.</p>",
