        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-31T14:50:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If the SDS sequence is destroyed, the cards under it just get discarded to the trash. When SDS specifically \"destroys\" cards under it, well that can activate effects that trigger on card destruction. The way the card is worded is correct.</p><p>And yes, Nightmist revealing a card from an empty deck leads to a dead spell.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:41:55.554Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
